    section: "C", questionRef: "2023 HL Section C Q4(a)(ii)",
    stem: "Large multinational companies have well established Just-in-Time (JIT) relationships with independent manufacturing contractors all over the world. Some sources of waste in lean manufacturing are identified as: overproduction, inventory, and transportation.",
